      "question_type": "MULTIPLE_CHOICE",
      "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
      "question_text": "After repeated exposure to inescapable electric shock, the experimental dog eventually made no further attempts to avoid shocks and appeared helpless and apathetic. This is an example of:",
